	(text "[■] POINT 06: 1.65V MIDPOINT REFERENCE DISTRIBUTION (VMID_REFF)\n    • Connect R44 (10k) and C34 (100n) bottom pins to GND.\n    • Route 1.65V node via R62 (22 Ω isolation resistor) to net VMID_REFF.\n    • Distribute VMID_REFF to:\n      1) INA333 (U8) Pin 5 (REF)\n      2) Input bias network R32\n      3) OPA2320 (U13B) Pin 7 (+INB)\n      4) Stimulation return (J11 Pin 2 & bottom of R46)\n\n[■] POINT 07: EC COUPLING CAPACITOR UPGRADE (C28)\n    • Change C28 from 1 µF to 100 µF (1206 MLCC, >= 6.3V rating).\n    • Lowers 16 Hz AC capacitive reactance (Xc) from ~9.95 kΩ to ~99.5 Ω.\n\n[■] POINT 08: ONE-WIRE TEMP SENSOR PULL-UP (J8 / DS18B20)\n    • Add 4.7 kΩ pull-up resistor between DS18B20_DATA and +3.3V rail.\n\n[■] POINT 09: C22 GROUND NET CORRECTION\n    • Re-route C22 ground pin from digital GNDA to intended GND net.\n\n[■] POINT 10: LED POWER SUPPLY RE-INTEGRATION\n    • Reconnect LED current-limiting resistors to +BATT supply (not VDD).\n\n[■] POINT 11: INA333 BIAS-RETURNS, U13 DECOUPLING & SHEET NOTES\n    • Add 10 MΩ bias-return resistors (R63, R64) from INA+ and INA- to VMID_REFF.\n    • Add 100 nF decoupling capacitor (C35) between U13 Pin 10 (+3.3VA) and GNDA.\n    • Update DIGI_&_ANA_SENSORS design text notes to reflect current Rev 3.5 schematic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.954 167.894 0)
